This update will be down for maintenance for 2 hours. During the update period, players cannot log in, play, etc.

[h3]V2.8.1 update content[/h3]
Fixed the problem that the cross-server map suit effect display was abnormal;
Fixed the abnormal prompt when refreshing the legendary captain in the recruitment interface;
Fixed the problem that the hidden ship function would hide the cross-server map BOSS;
Fixed the problem that the effects of the running bull set and the jade rabbit set were displayed abnormally when they were equipped with the same ship;
Fixed the problem that the odds of getting the Ruitu lottery for the Jade Rabbit set were abnormal;
Fixed the abnormal display effect of the Jade Rabbit set artifact;
Fixed a stuck issue in the Indian Ocean Challenge;

