[b] [VIP]: [/b] Recharge a certain amount of gold to become a VIP player and enjoy the corresponding VIP benefits. The higher the VIP level, the better the welfare;

[b] [Navigation]: [/b] View the game map, click the city on the map, and you can navigate to it automatically. Use the [Flying Shoes] button to reach the destination instantly;

[b] [High seas]: [/b] It is a link between Northern Europe and Western Europe. You can fight BOSS on the high seas, play PK with players and other important games on the high seas;

[b] [Trade]: [/b] Goods in Western Europe need to be sold in Northern Europe for profit, and vice versa.
Purchase navigation: check the purchase price of goods in each city;
Sales navigation: check the profit of the purchased goods in each city, click the city name to automatically navigate to.

[b] [Currency]: [/b] There are silver/gold coins in the game;
Silver coins: mostly obtained for trade, which can unlock goods, shipbuilding, etc. One of the currencies indispensable to the game;
Gold coins: can be obtained through game recharge; (Recharge can not only obtain gold coins, but also increase the VIP level;)

[b] [Employment]: [/b] The captain is an important factor affecting [combat effectiveness] and can be obtained by employment. The best quality of the captain is orange, followed by purple, blue, green and white. You can use the [Refresh] function to create a high-quality captain before hiring. (VIP players can give free refreshes every day)

[b] [Captain]: [/b] The place to view the captain's information;
Quality: The captain's quality is orange, followed by purple, blue, green and white.
Rising stars: the captain will become a level 1 after rising stars, and can be upgraded again to obtain high-quality multi stimulation opportunities;
Re practice: When the upgrade and stimulation are not ideal, you can use this function to downgrade to one level, upgrade again and stimulate again, which is a convenient way to create a captain of [Attribute Specialization]!
Upgrade: You can use the [Upgrade] function directly if you don't have time to practice captain slowly.
Directional upgrade: [Re practice] troublesome? Then directly use [Directed Upgrade] and select the corresponding attribute to directly trigger! Full attack and full defense is not a dream!
Skill: The place where the captain learns [Skill]. The active skill makes you more powerful in battle, while the passive skill makes the captain's attribute permanently increased. Skills can be obtained from various [skill copies].

[b] [Mailbox]: [/b] The place to check and write letters; (Rewards for game activities are usually distributed by letter)

[b] [Mall]: [/b] The place where the game sells various equipment/experience cards;

[b] [Ranking]: [/b] Check the player's combat effectiveness/level/silver coins/ships/captains/battle places;

[b] [Enhancement]: [/b] You can strengthen existing equipment. The higher the enhancement level, the higher the equipment attribute. You can use various [Enhancement Stones] to increase the success rate.

[b] [Shipbuilding]: [/b] The place where the ship is built; The [Shipbuilding Upgrade Tree] can select two routes: [battleship] and [merchant ship]. Players can choose according to their own needs, or they can match the battleship with the merchant ship;

[b] [Copy]: [/b] The place where players can obtain various quality equipment/skills/ship materials. The reward item obtained by the copy can only enter the warehouse after returning to the city of its own faction. (VIP has free days every day. The higher the VIP level, the more free times.)

[b] [Profits Today]: [/b] The higher the target is achieved, the better the treasure chest will be.

[b] [Trials]: [/b] The higher the rank, the better the reward.

[b] [Daily activities]: [/b] Including two limited time activities of [Hot Goods] and [High Seas BOSS Battle], a lot of rewards are waiting for you!
When you cannot enter the city or the open sea, use the flying shoes to enter the city once or enter the replica once to recover!

[b] [Reward Task]: [/b] Complete the reward task to obtain a large number of silver coins, skills and experience cards, which can be refreshed once a day for free!

