[b] Q: [/b] Is it too difficult for the captain to brush?
[b] A: [/b] The vip players have free refresh times every day (in addition, vip10 players can refresh the captain for 1w times every day for free, and a single automatic refresh of 1W times will lead to a 5-star captain);

[b] Q: [/b] How can I downgrade one level by using repeated practice cards?
[b] A: [/b] [Re practice card] allows the captain to re practice once for free;

[b] Q: [/b] With two purple captain cards, the captain has no long experience?
[b] A: [/b] The captain level cannot exceed trade level 3;

[b] Q: [/b] If captain of three stars learned skills, and after being promoted to captain of four stars, the level changed to level 1, will the skills learned disappear?
[b] A: [/b] will not disappear, and the learned skills will be retained;

[b] Q: [/b] Did you lose a ship you built?
[b] A: [/b] Ships are synthetic shipbuilding, so it needs to consume low-grade ships. The [Captain Queue] button in [Fleet] can replace ships;

[b] Q: [/b] There are enough silver coins and materials. Why did I withhold gold coins and cash gifts when building ships?
[b] A: [/b] If the quantity of silver coins and materials is sufficient, please check whether the grade of the material ship meets the requirements;

[b] Q: [/b] The purple cargo fell when the ship was joined;
[b] A: [/b] If the materials of the combined ship carry goods, the system will sell them at the current highest trade price when the ship is combined;

[b] Q: [/b] After building a new ship, arrange the fleet, unload all the equipment on the ship, and then reassemble, many equipment will disappear?
[b]A：[/b]
1. If the warehouse explodes after unloading, the equipment will enter the mailbox, please pay attention to check;
2. If there are more than 200 emails, the system will delete the earliest emails. It is recommended that you leave enough space;

[b] Q: [/b] Are all the materials I typed in the copy missing?
[b] A: [/b] After returning to the city where your faction is located, the replica loot in the treasure cabin will automatically enter the warehouse;

[b] Q: [/b] What does it mean that the sky pass of primary equipment copy falls out automatically?
[b] A: [/b] Each copy has a time limit. If the copy is not cleared within the time limit, the copy fails;

[b] Q: [/b] Why can't I take out the goods in my treasure warehouse?
[b] A: [/b] You need to go back to the city of your influence, and the treasure cabin goods will automatically enter the warehouse;

[b] Q: [/b] Why can't Western Europe attack Northern Europe just now?
[b] A: [/b] There are smaller protection areas at both ends of the high seas, where you can't fight with players;

[b] Q: [/b] Can't you buy purple goods for games?
[b] A: [/b] The price and quantity of goods in the game are completely affected by the trading behavior of each player in the game. However, even if short selling occurs, the quantity of goods will refresh every other period of time;

[b] Q: [/b] After the number of trade is zero, you can buy and sell?
[b] A: [/b] The number of times you can buy trade by spending gold coins;

[b] Q: [/b] Why does the amount of gift money consumed not accumulate in orange goods?
[b] A: [/b] You consumed gift gold/gold coins today. You need to refresh [XO brandy]/[refined navigation compass] according to your consumption in the morning of the next day;

[b] Q: [/b] Why can't one of the goods in full warehouse be sold? Want to waste a trade to sell?
[b] A: [/b] The maximum quantity of goods sold each time cannot exceed the maximum load of the ship!
Note: If the ship cabin is changed in the middle of trade or the captain has the ability to increase the load, the goods will not be sold out at one time;

[b] Q: [/b] How can the price of the number of trade purchases vary?
[b] A: [/b] The price of trade times will increase with the number of purchases;

[b] Q: [/b] The goods of elite rifles have been grabbed many times, but they can't be bought?
[b] A: [/b] [Elite Rifles] are the best orange goods, which need to be snapped up by players;

[b] Q: [/b] Why did you rob the goods. How many times do you sell?
[b] A: [/b] Regardless of the source of goods, sales are calculated as one trade;

[b] Q: [/b] Why didn't you send me a trade gift package?
[b] A: [/b] Players who defeat forces in trade at 0:00 every day can obtain [Trade War Gift Bag]. (For example, the force that defeated the trade at 0 o'clock today is Western Europe, and players from Western Europe who participated in the trade war can get the trade war gift package);

[b] Q: [/b] My equipment enhancement has dropped from 15 to 9?
[b] A: [/b] Continue strengthening after strengthening+10. If it fails, there is a chance to strengthen the level drop; (If the level cannot be dropped before strengthening+9);

[b] Q: [/b] How did the combat effectiveness decrease?
[b] A: [/b] The combat effectiveness is determined by the ships, equipment and captain of your current fleet;

[b] Q: [/b] I want to choose Northern Europe, but I chose the wrong one. Can I change it?
[b] A: [/b] The game does not have the ability to change factions at present.
